      "reasoning": "### Blocking Decision:\n\
- **Archaeomender** (2/3) can block one of the **Drake Tokens** (3/3 flying).\n\
  - If I block, **Archaeomender** will die (2 < 3), and I will take **3 damage** from the other **Drake Token** and **6 damage** from **Siege Striker**, totaling **9 damage** (lethal).\n\
  - If I don’t block, I take **3 + 3 + 6 = 12 damage** (lethal).\n\
- Neither option saves me, but blocking reduces the damage taken.\n\
\n\
### Optimal Play:\n\
- Block one **Drake Token** with **Archaeomender** to minimize damage and force the opponent to rebuild.\n\
\n\
---\n\
